	(text "LM5165Y-Q1  24V -> 3.3V  PFM MODE  (ref: TI SNVSAJ3C, Design 2)\nVin(nom)=24V  Vin(op)=24-28V  Vin(max)=32V (rail limit, TPS56A37 abs max)\nVout=3.3V (fixed, Y version)  Iout(target)=50mA  Iout(max)=60mA\n\nMODE: RT tied to GND -> PFM (light-load efficiency)\n\nR_ILIM = 56.2k (1%) -> Ipk = 120mA\n  PFM: Iout(max) = Ipk/2 = 60mA  (design target 50mA)\n\nL_F = 47uH, Isat >= 0.5A  (Coilcraft LPS4018-473MRC)\n  Eq.19: Fsw = (Vout/(L*Ipk)) * (1 - Vout/Vin)\n         Ipk = 120mA * 1.1 = 132mA (comparator delay margin)\n         Fsw @24V = (3.3/(47u*0.132)) * (1 - 3.3/24) = ~459kHz\n         Fsw @28V = (3.3/(47u*0.132)) * (1 - 3.3/28) = ~469kHz\n  Eq.20: L_min = Vin(max) * ton(min) / IL(max)\n         = 32V * 180ns / 0.25A = 23.0uH  -> 47uH OK\n         (still OK at 45V: 32.4uH)\n  Isat margin: 0.5A >> Ipk 132mA OK\n\nC_OUT = 22uF, 10V, X7R, 0805  (~11uF eff @3.3V DC bias)\n  Eq.22: Cout >= 100 * L * (Ipk/Vout)^2\n         = 100 * 47u * (0.132/3.3)^2 = 7.5uF  -> 11uF eff OK\n  Eq.21: dVout = Iout*4us/Cout + Vout/123\n         @12mA = 12m*4u/11u + 3.3/123 = 4.4mV + 26.8mV = ~31mV pk-pk\n\nC_IN = 1uF, 100V, X7R  (rating >= 2x Vin(max) = 64V OK)\n  Bulk: shared 100uF 50V electrolytic (C1) at 24V input connector\n  D1 SMBJ26A TVS footprint at connector: DNP\n    -> populate if hot-plug scope peak on VIN > ~30V\n\nPIN CONFIG:\n  VOUT   -> output node (internal FB divider, Y version)\n  EN     -> VIN (always on)\n  SS     -> open (internal 900us soft start)\n  HYS    -> open\n  PGOOD  -> optional: 100k pull-up to 3.3V ONLY (abs max 16V)\n            rises at 94% Vout (~3.1V), falls at 87% (~2.87V)\n  RT     -> GND (PFM mode)\n  ILIM   -> 56.2k to GND\n  PAD    -> GND with thermal vias"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 129.54 93.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "18b374d3-fb77-4ade-acb7-8f1b0858924f")
	)
	(text "TPS56A37  24-28V -> 12V  8A  (ref: TI SLVSHC9, Table 7-2 @ 500kHz)\nVin(min)=24V  Vin(max)=28V  Vout=12V  Iout=8A  fsw=500kHz  Vref=0.6V\n\nFROM TABLE 7-2 (12V row):\n  L1 = 5.6uH   R5 = 20k   C_FF = 30pF   C_OUT = 22uF x2 typ (x1 min, x10 max)\n  R_MODE = 52.3k 1% (required)\n\nR4 (Eq.6):  Vout = 0.6 * (1 + R4/R5)\n  R4 = R5 * (Vout/0.6 - 1) = 20k * 19 = 380k -> 383k (E96)\n  Vout = 0.6 * (1 + 383/20) = 12.09V\n\nL_RIPPLE (Eq.8, @Vin max):\n  dI = (Vout/Vin) * (Vin - Vout) / (L * fsw)\n     = (12/28) * 16 / (5.6u * 500k) = 2.45A\nL_PEAK (Eq.9):  Ipk = Iout + dI/2 = 8 + 1.22 = 9.22A\nL_RMS (Eq.10):  Irms = sqrt(Iout^2 + dI^2/12) = 8.03A\n  -> L1: Isat >= 15A, Irms >= 10A\n\nOCL CHECK:\n  Valley = 8 - 1.22 = 6.78A  < 10A (ILS_OCL min)    OK\n  Peak   = 9.22A             < 12.75A (IHS_OCL min) OK\n\nC_OUT RMS (Eq.11):\n  Ico = Vout*(Vin-Vout) / (sqrt(12)*Vin*L*fsw)\n      = 12*16 / (3.464*28*5.6u*500k) = 0.71A\n  -> 4x 22uF 25V X7R 1210 (GRM32ER71E226KE15L), extra for motor load steps\n\nC_IN RMS (Eq.13, @Vin min):\n  Icin = Iout * sqrt((Vout/Vin) * (Vin-Vout)/Vin) = 8 * 0.5 = 4.0A\nC_IN RIPPLE (Eq.12):\n  dVin = Iout*0.25 / (Cin*fsw)\n  @ ~24uF eff (4x 10uF 50V, ~6uF each @24V) -> 167mV\n  -> 4x 10uF 50V X7R 1210 + 100nF 50V 0402 at VIN\n  -> 47-100uF 50V electrolytic bulk at connector (hot-plug damping)\n\nSOFT START (Eq.2):  Tss = Css*Vref/Iss = 22n*0.6/6u = 2.2ms\n\nC_BOOT: 100nF X5R+ >= 10V ceramic, BOOT-SW\nPG:     100k pull-up to <= 5.5V\nEN:     open (internal pull-up, always on)\n\nTHERMAL (estimate, D=0.5 @24V, 1.4x hot Rds, tsw ~10ns):\n  P_HS = 64 * 0.0194 * 0.5 * 1.4 = 0.87W\n  P_LS = 64 * 0.0085 * 0.5 * 1.4 = 0.38W\n  P_SW = 0.5 * 28 * 8 * 10n * 500k = 0.56W\n  P_total ~ 1.8W\n  dTj = 1.8W * 30C/W = ~54C  (4-layer, thermal vias REQUIRED)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.894 177.038 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1b7cdaf6-fd97-48cd-b072-ccf27766a64a")
	)
